WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.903 --> 00:00:04.204
So what do you want
to do tonight?

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:05.873
Like, I was thinking
maybe we could meet up

00:00:05.873 --> 00:00:07.541
with Amy and Brad,
and, like, before that,

00:00:07.541 --> 00:00:09.142
we could go to Angela's,
and before that,

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.410
we could, like, just go--

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.880
Meegan.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.915
I have something
to say.

00:00:17.084 --> 00:00:18.285
[exhales sharply]

00:00:18.285 --> 00:00:20.120
I had to say it
in person

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.891
because it's--
it's, like, super important.

00:00:25.926 --> 00:00:28.762
Okay.

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:30.597
Um...

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:33.100
I know this is sudden,
but, like,

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.436
I've been thinking
about this for a while.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:40.407
And I know this is something
that needs to happen.

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:41.775
I'm breaking up
with you.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.277
Cool.
Love it.

00:00:43.277 --> 00:00:45.412
Totally fine
with that.

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:51.418
- R-Really?
- Yeah.

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:53.620
'Cause I thought--

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.088
I was really worried

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:57.658
that you were
gonna be, like, mad.

00:00:57.658 --> 00:00:59.526
Mad?
Oh, my God.

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:01.028
Are you kidding me?

00:01:01.028 --> 00:01:03.597
No, of course
I'm not mad.

00:01:03.597 --> 00:01:05.265
People grow apart.
It happens.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:06.533
It's, like,
part of life.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:07.768
No, I'm totally fine.

00:01:07.768 --> 00:01:11.038
Like, love it,
love it, love it.

00:01:11.038 --> 00:01:13.407
Um...
[clears throat]

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:15.909
So...

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.544
Uh, um...

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.880
we had a good run.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:20.948
Yeah.

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:27.888
And, uh, don't be
a stranger.

00:01:27.888 --> 00:01:30.524
Can I just--

00:01:30.524 --> 00:01:32.626
Can I ask why?

00:01:32.626 --> 00:01:34.928
- Why?
- Yeah, like, whatevs.

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.563
Like, I'm doing some work
on myself

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:38.198
and, like, trying to grow
as a person,

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:41.134
so I'd really, like,
appreciate to know why.

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:42.769
Yeah, um...

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:44.504
Okay, yeah,
that's, like--

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.873
You know, I think
that you're kind of, like,

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:49.109
a controlling
person who--

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.477
Thank you.
Thank you for that.

00:01:50.477 --> 00:01:53.447
That's nice.
Thank you for that.

00:01:53.447 --> 00:01:55.148
Cool.
No problem.

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:57.351
So you know what
your problem is, Andre?

00:01:57.351 --> 00:01:58.552
What?

00:01:58.552 --> 00:02:01.588
You keep tabs
on people.

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:02.990
Every little thing
somebody does,

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:06.560
you have to keep
a tab of it.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:09.563
Wait. I-I can't tell
if you're angry or not.

00:02:09.563 --> 00:02:10.697
I'm not.

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:13.066
Mm, totally not angry.

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:14.301
No, I'm excited.
It's good.

00:02:14.301 --> 00:02:16.536
It's just, like,
you said your piece,

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:20.040
and I just think
that I deserve the human decency

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.441
to say my piece.

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:22.476
Right, right.

00:02:22.476 --> 00:02:24.578
Is that--
is that not okay?

00:02:24.578 --> 00:02:26.847
No, no, no.
It's--

00:02:26.847 --> 00:02:29.016
Of course, of course.

00:02:29.016 --> 00:02:30.817
You're a controlling,
manipulative person.

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:32.185
Everyone says that.

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:33.687
I-I don't think
that I am.

00:02:33.687 --> 00:02:35.689
Yes, you are, Andre.

00:02:35.689 --> 00:02:39.493
Yes, you mother[bleep] are.

00:02:39.493 --> 00:02:41.662
Okay, now--now,
you sound pretty angry.

00:02:41.662 --> 00:02:43.897
I'm not angry!

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:45.999
I'm not angry.
I'm fine.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.000
I love it!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.835
I love that you came
to my house,

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.670
and you broke up with me
in my space.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.672
And I'm gonna think about that
every time I'm here.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:54.241
That's great.
That is so perfect for me.

00:02:54.241 --> 00:02:56.510
[crying]
It's the best thing
that's ever happened to me.

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:57.844
Where else was
I supposed to do it?

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.179
'Cause you won't come
to my house.

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:01.948
Oh, here he is.
The puppet master is back.

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:03.683
But I'm not--
No, I'm not the puppet master.

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:05.085
Why are you
doing this to me?

00:03:05.085 --> 00:03:06.653
It's true.
You won't come to my house.

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:08.355
You said my apartment
looks like two rats

00:03:08.355 --> 00:03:09.890
just [bleep] in it
every [bleep] day.

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:11.892
Oh, right,
like, thank you for that.

00:03:11.892 --> 00:03:13.193
I'm a bitch.
Thank you.

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:14.728
I didn't call--
no, I didn't say "bitch."

00:03:14.728 --> 00:03:15.829
- I didn't--
- Which is it?

00:03:15.829 --> 00:03:17.164
Am I evil,
or am I a bitch?

00:03:17.164 --> 00:03:18.465
No, no, you're
not evil, Meegan.

00:03:18.465 --> 00:03:20.267
Well, then why
are you punishing me?

00:03:20.267 --> 00:03:22.302
I'm not punishing you.
I'm not--

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:23.470
You broke up with me,

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.005
and I'm not supposed
to feel punished.

00:03:25.005 --> 00:03:27.441
- Who thinks like that?
- [shouting]

00:03:27.441 --> 00:03:29.476
I don't know!
I'm sorry.

00:03:29.476 --> 00:03:31.244
I'm sorry,
okay, Meegan?

00:03:31.244 --> 00:03:32.779
I guess I didn't think
it through.

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:34.114
Well, it's, like,
too late now.

00:03:34.114 --> 00:03:36.016
- I mean, we're done.
- No, it's not too late.

00:03:36.016 --> 00:03:38.218
Meegan, Meegan,
seriously, I just--

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:41.621
I-I-I had a feeling
that I thought was true,

00:03:41.621 --> 00:03:43.957
and clearly--
clearly it wasn't true.

00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:46.126
Like, I'm so confused.

00:03:46.126 --> 00:03:47.461
Like, are you
breaking up with me,

00:03:47.461 --> 00:03:48.795
or are you not
breaking up with me?

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:51.598
Meegan, I'm not
breaking up with you!

00:03:51.598 --> 00:03:53.433
Okay, cool. So what do you want
to do tonight?

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.035
Like, I want to hang out
with Amy and Brad,

00:03:55.035 --> 00:03:56.903
but maybe before that,
we can go to Angela's.

00:03:56.903 --> 00:03:59.906
[dark music]

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:01.241
♪ ♪

00:04:01.241 --> 00:04:03.243
What just happened?

